OL,3,GNEWSA'A broken lift contributed to my
OL,4,Amum's death'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has claimed that a broken lift
OL,7,Fin her elderly mother's block of flats
OL,8,Fcontributed to her death.
OL,10,FResidents in the three-storey building
OL,11,Fin Camberley, Surrey, have been without
OL,12,Fa lift since it stopped working in
OL,13,FMarch.
OL,15,FNicky Dowman told the BBC "traversing
OL,16,Fthe stairs up and down on a near-daily
OL,17,Fbasis really took a toll" on her
OL,18,F87-year-old mum Audrey West, who had
OL,19,Frheumatoid arthritis and chronic
OL,20,Fobstructive pulmonary disease (COPD), a
OL,21,Flung condition.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,327,320,200,140,0,100
