OL,3,GNEWSA'A broken lift contributed to my
OL,4,Amum's death'
OL,5,
OL,6,FProperty manager FirstPort said it took
OL,7,Faction "from the outset" to address the
OL,8,Fimpact on residents from the lift,
OL,9,Fwhich needed a "comprehensive upgrade"
OL,10,Fafter it broke down.
